<h1 data-copy-en="Motley" data-copy-zh="Motley">Motley</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Follow Motley’s Syndicate story, four conversations, Comedy Timing and Propaganda appreciation." data-copy-zh="推进Motley的辛迪加路线、四段交心、喜剧节奏课程及宣传答谢事件。">Follow Motley’s Syndicate story, four conversations, Comedy Timing and Propaganda appreciation.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Motley_and_Unlocking_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Personal_Scene_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Requirements_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Audience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One_Honest_Minute"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Last_Inch"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Place_to_Return"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Supporting_Syndicate_Scenes"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Motley — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/harlequin.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Motley — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/harlequin.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Motley — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Motley leads the Chaos Syndicate. Her personal story, three sequential conversations and separate alliance follow-up are interwoven with the group route. Scene outcomes and background revelations are left to play.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beat_85_Alliance_and_Army_Access"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Her normal portrait is at Motley's Lair, all day. Enter through the Future Prime Sector’s Syndicate Gates. Two personal scenes instead occur in The Den; the early interview is 06:00–09:00.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Route_Boundaries"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Begin the gates and lair introductions, then The Boss Takes Notice after Kitty’s recruitment-related mission. Talk opens at Acquaintance 50; use the group scenes for early affection rather than waiting for a Stranger conversation.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Welcome to the Circus</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Boss Takes Notice</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Taming the Rookie / Welcome to the Circus</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Interview</th><td data-label="Location / start window">The Den; 06:00–08:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Observation</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Tell</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after The Observation</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Game</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Honeypot / The Confession</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Reckoning</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Confession / The Game</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Summons</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after The Tell / Zodiac’s later Syndicate scene</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Fascination</th><td data-label="Location / start window">The Den</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after The Summons</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Dissection</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after The Fascination</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Truth</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Motley's Lair</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after The Dissection</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">No Audience</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 10 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">One Honest Minute</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after No Audience</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 10 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Last Inch</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); after The Truth / One Honest Minute</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Place to Return</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after Our War</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 10 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The early personal conversations are No Audience at Friend 100, then One Honest Minute at Close Friend 200. The Last Inch later needs Romantic 800, the second conversation and The Truth.</p><p>For the automatic story, raise Friend 100 and Close Friend 200 for Observation → Tell, then finish Zodiac’s required group progression before the Crush 400 summons. Continue Den → lair → lair at the stages shown. The group’s Game/Reckoning branch has its own council and Zodiac prerequisites.</p><p>After Our War, A Place to Return is a separate Friend 100 alliance conversation,60 min/10 Energy, once. It does not require the three personal conversations in sequence.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Motley's Lair; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Comedy Timing</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Motley's Lair; Friend (100); Creativity 16</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">150 min; $250; 30 Energy; 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+12 base affection; learn Comedy Timing once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Them a Reason</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Motley's Lair; In Love (3000); affection 3000; after The Truth / Our War / The Last Inch / A Place to Return; all day</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 Propaganda; once per run</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Comedy Timing teaches Comedy Timing at Friend 100/Creativity 16:150 min/$250/30 Energy/20 Calm,12 base affection, once.</p><p>At In Love 3000, Give Them a Reason awards 1 Propaganda once per run,0 min. First complete The Truth, Our War, The Last Inch and A Place to Return. The shared alliance guide covers Army access and later faction events.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Rogue, Charm. Learning Silver Tongue improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If Talk is absent below 50, continue the introductory and shared Syndicate scenes.</li><li>For the Crush-stage summons, check Zodiac’s group chain as well as the preceding observation scenes.</li><li>The interview is in the Den 06:00–09:00, not the normal lair portrait.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">Shared Syndicate and alliance route</a></li><li><a href="character-zodiac.html">Zodiac</a></li><li><a href="character-kitty.html">Kitty</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army and Propaganda</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Motley_and_Unlocking_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Personal_Scene_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Requirements_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Audience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One_Honest_Minute"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Last_Inch"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Place_to_Return"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Supporting_Syndicate_Scenes"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Motley 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/harlequin.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Motley 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/harlequin.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Motley 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Motley领导混沌辛迪加。个人剧情、三段顺序交心及独立的联盟后续与团体路线交织；事件结果与背景揭示留待游戏中发现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beat_85_Alliance_and_Army_Access"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>普通头像全天位于Motley的巢穴，从未来核心区的辛迪加大门进入。两段个人事件改在巢穴，早期访谈在06:00–09:00开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Route_Boundaries"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先完成大门和巢穴介绍，再于Kitty相关招募任务后推进老大注意到了你。交谈要求相识50，早期请通过共同事件积累好感，不必等待陌生人阶段的交谈。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">欢迎来到马戏团</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">老大注意到了你</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">完成：驯服菜鸟、欢迎来到马戏团</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">访谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巢穴；06:00–08:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观察</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">破绽</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：观察</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游戏</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">完成：美人计、告白</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">清算</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）；完成：告白、游戏</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">传唤</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400好感）；完成：破绽、Zodiac的后续辛迪加事件</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">迷恋</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400好感）；完成：传唤</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">剖析</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800好感）；完成：迷恋</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">真相</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800好感）；完成：剖析</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">谢绝观众</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；10精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">坦诚的一分钟</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：谢绝观众</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；10精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">最后一寸</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800好感）；完成：真相、坦诚的一分钟</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">能够回来的地方</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100好感）；完成：我们的战争</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；10精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>早期交心为朋友100的谢绝观众，然后亲密朋友200的坦诚的一分钟。较后的最后一寸要求浪漫感800、第二次交心及真相。</p><p>自动剧情先在朋友100、亲密朋友200推进观察与破绽，再完成Zodiac相关团体进度，才能在迷恋400触发召见。之后按下表要求前往巢穴，再返回Motley的巢穴两次。游戏／清算分支另有会议和Zodiac前置。</p><p>完成我们的战争后，朋友100可进行独立的联盟交心能够回来的地方，60分钟、10精力，仅一次；不要求先按顺序完成三段个人交心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Motley的巢穴；相识（50好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">喜剧节奏</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Motley的巢穴；朋友（100好感）；创造力16</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">150分钟；$250；30精力；20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+12；学习喜剧节奏，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">给他们一个理由</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Motley的巢穴；恋爱中（3000好感）；好感3000；完成：真相、我们的战争、最后一寸、能够回来的地方；全天</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">宣传+1；本轮仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>喜剧节奏要求朋友100、创造力16，150分钟、$250、30精力、20镇定，增加12基础好感，仅学习一次。</p><p>恋爱中3000可进行给他们一个理由，0分钟，宣传+1，本轮仅一次。先完成真相、我们的战争、最后一寸及能够回来的地方。军团开放和后续阵营事件见共同联盟指南。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、盗贼、魅力。学会巧舌如簧可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>不足50好感无法交谈时，先推进介绍和共同辛迪加事件。</li><li>迷恋阶段的召见除观察事件外，还需Zodiac的团体进度。</li><li>早期访谈在巢穴06:00–09:00，不是在普通Motley头像处。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">辛迪加与联盟共同路线</a></li><li><a href="character-zodiac.html">Zodiac</a></li><li><a href="character-kitty.html">Kitty</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">军团与宣传</a></li></ul></section>
